" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{4}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4\\int \\frac{1}{1+(5 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4(\\frac{1}{5})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "ef7b058e-fc6a-5813-9eb1-d41bf53d2867" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "ef7b058e-fc6a-5813-9eb1-d41bf53d2867" :question/answer-fields "b0d76d60-375d-5a12-b771-5d768e620be3"] [:db/ensure "ef7b058e-fc6a-5813-9eb1-d41bf53d2867" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "ef7b058e-fc6a-5813-9eb1-d41bf53d2867"] [:db/add "522f0b49-36d3-5564-8587-88f69e0b4972" :answer/id #uuid "522f0b49-36d3-5564-8587-88f69e0b4972"] [:db/add "522f0b49-36d3-5564-8587-88f69e0b4972" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "522f0b49-36d3-5564-8587-88f69e0b4972" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{7} x \\right)}}{7}+C"] [:db/ensure "522f0b49-36d3-5564-8587-88f69e0b4972" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6e79f9b7-9587-51cb-9715-6d0667bfbe94" :answer/id #uuid "6e79f9b7-9587-51cb-9715-6d0667bfbe94"] [:db/add "6e79f9b7-9587-51cb-9715-6d0667bfbe94" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6e79f9b7-9587-51cb-9715-6d0667bfbe94" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{7} x \\right)}}{7}+C"] [:db/ensure "6e79f9b7-9587-51cb-9715-6d0667bfbe94" :answer/validate] [:db/add "73505e5a-61de-522f-98f5-f372a4aff84d" :answer/id #uuid "73505e5a-61de-522f-98f5