[:db/ensure "6c913ac6-a686-52ea-8fea-4ea5396bf730" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/id #uuid "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067"] [:db/add "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{7 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=\\sqrt{7} x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sqrt{7},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{4}{7 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{7} x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 4(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{7}}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{7}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{4 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{7} x \\right)}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/answer-fields "6c913ac6-a686-52ea-8fea-4ea5396bf730"] [:db/ensure "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "f49dc8f2-18d9-5ea1-864b-63e28786f067"] [:db/add "be1fd41f-de13-59ad-adea-a77d1673b296" :answer/id #uuid "be1fd41f-de13-59ad-adea-a77d1673b296"] [:db/add "be1fd41f-de13-59ad-adea-a77d1673b296" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "be1fd41f-de13-59ad-adea-a77d1673b296" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{8}+C"] [:db/ensure "be1fd41f-de13-59ad-adea-a77d1673b296" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8a786436-9219-596e-