85-8484-983954e623d2" :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=\\sqrt{10} x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sqrt{10},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{10 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{10} x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{10}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c8750434-5b20-5785-8484-983954e623d2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c8750434-5b20-5785-8484-983954e623d2" :question/answer-fields "e500327f-0b20-5c07-a644-e2c771db1482"] [:db/ensure "c8750434-5b20-5785-8484-983954e623d2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "c8750434-5b20-5785-8484-983954e623d2"] [:db/add "f05464ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49" :answer/id #uuid "f05464ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49"] [:db/add "f05464ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f05464ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49" :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "f05464ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a" :answer/id #uuid "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a"] [:db/add "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "647c93b4-4022