64ff-866e-548c-a5c5-f724edae6e49"] [:db/ensure "4f5bcf49-2519-5a78-82d8-d2a7e774ebe6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/id #uuid "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c"] [:db/add "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4(1+(\\frac{1}{4})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{2}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{8}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{2})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2(2)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 4\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/answer-fields "4f5bcf49-2519-5a78-82d8-d2a7e774ebe6"] [:db/ensure "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "893a3dea-aca6-502a-8459-3475a2d5f36c"] [:db/add "d2ef1263-5631-591f-b9bf-9f3b133aa72b" :answer/id #uuid "d2ef1263-5631-591f-b9bf-9f3b133aa72b"] [:db/add "d2ef1263-5631-591f-b9bf-9f3b133aa72b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d2ef1263-5631-591f-b9bf-9f3b133aa72b" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{7} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "d2ef1263-5631-591f-b9bf-9f3b133aa72b" :answer/validate