athrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{3})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(3)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 3\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a3f2cb6b-15b8-5ca3-8303-5a5f3b19e4bd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a3f2cb6b-15b8-5ca3-8303-5a5f3b19e4bd" :question/answer-fields "13f62dcd-6874-5653-bf6b-6cc7bfdeabac"] [:db/ensure "a3f2cb6b-15b8-5ca3-8303-5a5f3b19e4bd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "a3f2cb6b-15b8-5ca3-8303-5a5f3b19e4bd"] [:db/add "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17" :answer/id #uuid "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17"] [:db/add "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "2d84c97a-224d-5ac1-be50-7e3484487e17" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6b97cd79-8c0e-5fc4-b493-8be41aef252c" :answer/id #uuid "6b97cd79-8c0e-5fc4-b493-8be41aef252c"] [:db/add "6b97cd79-8c0e-5fc4-b493-8be41aef252c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6b97cd79-8c0e-5fc4-b493-8be41aef252c" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "6b97cd79-8c0e-5fc4-b493-8be41aef252c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "23fb85f4-ddbe-5cc9-ab0d-60e54e5923a5" :answer/id #uuid "23fb85f4-ddbe-5cc9-ab0d-60e54e5923a5"] [:db/add "23fb85f4-ddbe-5cc9-ab0d-60e54e5923a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "23fb85f4-ddbe-5cc9-ab0d-60e54e5923a5" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{