:db/add "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{6}{x^{2} + 36}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 36=36(1+(\\frac{1}{36})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{6},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(6)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{6}{x^{2} + 36}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{6})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{6}(6)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3" :question/answer-fields "28f53a1f-aec7-56ce-a32a-047c289dbea1"] [:db/ensure "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "da5029da-63e2-508a-a4ed-eaf480260df3"] [:db/add "55bbad3c-c50c-5e9a-8517-a624d325a0b3" :answer/id #uuid "55bbad3c-c50c-5e9a-8517-a624d325a0b3"] [:db/add "55bbad3c-c50c-5e9a-8517-a624d325a0b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "55bbad3c-c50c-5e9a-8517-a624d325a0b3" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{8}+C"] [:db/ensure "55bbad3c-c50c-5e9a-8517-a624d325a0b3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "17780bed-4359-5126-81c4-a87852eeacd3" :answer/id #uuid "17780bed-4359-5126-81c4-a87852eeacd3"] [:db/add "17780bed-4359-5126-81c4-a87852eeacd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add