nometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{8}{x^{2} + 64}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}(8)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "d91f82e1-a5f1-59df-8ebb-04c941947778" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d91f82e1-a5f1-59df-8ebb-04c941947778" :question/answer-fields "06b95b7d-9317-5427-b34d-9ac5f182aac0"] [:db/ensure "d91f82e1-a5f1-59df-8ebb-04c941947778" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "d91f82e1-a5f1-59df-8ebb-04c941947778"] [:db/add "6915e116-1429-5a3d-90cb-b690b761d7f3" :answer/id #uuid "6915e116-1429-5a3d-90cb-b690b761d7f3"] [:db/add "6915e116-1429-5a3d-90cb-b690b761d7f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6915e116-1429-5a3d-90cb-b690b761d7f3" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{21}+C"] [:db/ensure "6915e116-1429-5a3d-90cb-b690b761d7f3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dbe0f613-0528-5577-bdd1-de1020e9994c" :answer/id #uuid "dbe0f613-0528-5577-bdd1-de1020e9994c"] [:db/add "dbe0f613-0528-5577-bdd1-de1020e9994c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dbe0f613-0528-5577-bdd1-de1020e9994c" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{7}+C"] [:db/ensure "dbe0f613-0528-5577-bdd1-de1020e9994c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8615610f-6718-58b0-a5cc-3146d3e191c7" :answer/id #uuid "8615610f-6718-58b0-a5cc-3146d3e191c7"] [:db/add "8615610f-6718-58b0-a5cc-3146d3e191c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8615610f-6718-58b0-a5cc-3146d3e191c7" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{21}+C"] [:db/ensure "8615610f-6