te the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{252 x^{2} + 7}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "08182b49-5105-5e47-82b6-061be00c1c00" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n252 x^{2} + 7=7(1+(36)x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=6 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{6})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{4}{252 x^{2} + 7}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(6 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{7}(\\frac{1}{6})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2}{21}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{21}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{21}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "08182b49-5105-5e47-82b6-061be00c1c00" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "08182b49-5105-5e47-82b6-061be00c1c00" :question/answer-fields "a3d30795-9bf1-5254-991e-6ab1bff62e9a"] [:db/ensure "08182b49-5105-5e47-82b6-061be00c1c00" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "08182b49-5105-5e47-82b6-061be00c1c00"] [:db/add "f2bacbd4-300f-5c95-9a1b-adb46900035f" :answer/id #uuid "f2bacbd4-300f-5c95-9a1b-adb46900035f"] [:db/add "f2bacbd4-300f-5c95-9a1b-adb46900035f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f2bacbd4-300f-5c95-9a1b-adb46900035f" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\right)}}{7}+C"] [:db/ensure "f2bacbd4-300f-5c95-9a1b-adb46900035f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8696acc0-a3e5-5d84-91ff-758690518877" :answer/id #uuid "8696acc0-a3e5-5d84-91ff-758690518877"] [:db/add "8696acc0-a3e5-5d84-91ff-758690518877" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8696acc0-a3e5-5d84-9