{2} + 25=25(1+(\\frac{1}{5})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\sqrt{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{7}{5 x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{25}(\\sqrt{5})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5}}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{25}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{25}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "55e18530-4dec-572d-a88b-ac0dc3c3ec5b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "55e18530-4dec-572d-a88b-ac0dc3c3ec5b" :question/answer-fields "6cef7d9c-3561-501c-a199-09a77b88cc10"] [:db/ensure "55e18530-4dec-572d-a88b-ac0dc3c3ec5b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "55e18530-4dec-572d-a88b-ac0dc3c3ec5b"] [:db/add "9c11befe-819f-5bde-9b9b-0a8eae816193" :answer/id #uuid "9c11befe-819f-5bde-9b9b-0a8eae816193"] [:db/add "9c11befe-819f-5bde-9b9b-0a8eae816193" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9c11befe-819f-5bde-9b9b-0a8eae816193" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "9c11befe-819f-5bde-9b9b-0a8eae816193" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cbbee414-a342-56e0-8aec-8562cf05d4ef" :answer/id #uuid "cbbee414-a342-56e0-8aec-8562cf05d4ef"] [:db/add "cbbee414-a342-56e0-8aec-8562cf05d4ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cbbee414-a342-56e0-8aec-8562cf05d4ef" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "cbbee414-a342-56e0-8aec-8562cf05d4ef" :answer/validate] 