d3fa8" :answer-field/correct "3fb86f00-a7d3-5e1c-ab6a-eef0c1e19200"] [:db/ensure "e55d26c5-0fc0-52a8-8e03-1e3787dd3fa8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/id #uuid "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3"] [:db/add "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{8 x^{2} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n8 x^{2} + 2=2(1+(4)x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=2 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{8 x^{2} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(2 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/answer-fields "e55d26c5-0fc0-52a8-8e03-1e3787dd3fa8"] [:db/ensure "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "f85c1197-a16c-562c-8e6f-5ec36344ebe3"] [:db/add "d777ad93-d0ad-5c26-9c7f-2358124a9722" :answer/id #uuid "d777ad93-d0ad-5c26-9c7f-2358124a9722"] [:db/add "d777ad93-d0ad-5c26-9c7f-2358124a9722" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d777ad93-d0ad-5c26-9c7f-2358124a9722" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\