peratorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{63 x^{2} + 7}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(3 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{7}(\\frac{1}{3})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{7}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "b65f9d67-eac4-5c1b-ba55-093731e10653" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b65f9d67-eac4-5c1b-ba55-093731e10653" :question/answer-fields "ce568bb9-c592-5247-881c-e3509e33d4c4"] [:db/ensure "b65f9d67-eac4-5c1b-ba55-093731e10653" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "b65f9d67-eac4-5c1b-ba55-093731e10653"] [:db/add "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-bfd6-f263e47cc945" :answer/id #uuid "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-bfd6-f263e47cc945"] [:db/add "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-bfd6-f263e47cc945" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-bfd6-f263e47cc945" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensure "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-bfd6-f263e47cc945" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221" :answer/id #uuid "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221"] [:db/add "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensure "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221" :answer/validate] [:db/add "222dd6f4-b70d-53fe-9d18-4de408229685" :answer/id #uuid "222dd6f4-b70d-53fe-9d18-4de408229685"] [:db/add "222dd6f4-b70d-53fe-9d18-4de408229685" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "222dd6f4-b70d-53fe-9d18-4de408229685" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensur