:db/add "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{5}{3 x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5" :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n3 x^{2} + 9=9(1+(\\frac{1}{3})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\sqrt{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{5}{3 x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{5}{9}(\\sqrt{3})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{9}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5" :question/answer-fields "6a3a75ad-9c36-5dc3-95a6-45a3e5d1f11c"] [:db/ensure "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "dfd7646e-d2d1-5aa8-a418-f07224a77ff5"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "43a62a8f-ae87-5167-9661-dd792df98f14"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/cf/cf5abaf1d5a4a7cb3dc47cd2081214a33752a2c515b04bac374bf14fb763103c/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/validate]]
